---
args: --set=types_pretty_printer_engine=old
---

Anonymous effect tails after operation fields
fun(_) {} : (() {F:()|_}-> ()) {F:()|_} -> ()
stdout : fun : (() {F:() => ()|_}-> ()) {F:() => ()|_}-> ()

Single-use effect tails
fun(_) { } : (() -e-> ()) -f-> ()
stdout : fun : (() -> ()) -> ()

Shared effect tail in curried arrows
fun()() { } : () -a-> () -a-> ()
stdout : fun : () -a-> () -a-> ()

Distinct effect tails across a tuple
(fun(){}, fun(){}) : (() -a-> (), () -b-> ())
stdout : (fun, fun) : (() -> (), () -> ())

Type aliases with a shared effect tail
fun(x) {x} : (Comp(a, { | e })) -f-> Comp(a, { | e })
stdout : fun : (Comp (a,{ |b })) -> Comp (a,{ |b })
